PASS R-bell g(|0>(x)b) = sqrt2 * psi exactly, g = U(x)P+ + V(x)P-, U, V in SU(2)
PASS R-singlet g(|0>(x)b) = sqrt2 * psi exactly, g = U(x)P+ + V(x)P-, U, V in SU(2)
PASS R-psi_d g(|0>(x)b) = sqrt2 * psi exactly, g = U(x)P+ + V(x)P-, U, V in SU(2)
PASS R-T target side: (P0(x)U + P1(x)V)(a(x)|0>) = psi_a exactly
